  m_Name: Caterer Caldwell
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Caterer Caldwell
  offerText: Allow me to clear out your rancid pantry supplies and replace them with
    my gourmet canned goods. It requires a small fee, but you will eat like a king.
  acceptResultText: Caldwell clears the old food and leaves the shiny cans. Your
    pantry looks spacious and you feel excited for a grand dinner tonight.
  rejectResultText: You tell the chef to leave. Your pantry remains a cluttered,
    stale mess, and your empty stomach rumbles painfully.
  acceptedDelayedText: You open one of Dupont's cans. The meat is violently spoiled
    and infested with parasites. You spend the entire night horribly, painfully ill.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
